      "message": "Should be ok for now. I agree it would be better to have a separate library containing just exported flags but the ones in frameworks.jar should be accessible by BT with no problems. Also in case there is a restriction on the hidden APIs we will check the caller permissions. In theory someone who has knowledge about the AIDL transaction IDs could call the hidden APIs without having the SDK",
